OL,3,ATurkish police raid opposition TV
OL,4,Astation, halting live broadcasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurkish police have raided the
OL,7,Fheadquarters of one of the country's
OL,8,Fmost-watched news channels, halting its
OL,9,Flive broadcasts.
OL,11,FReports in Turkish media said financial
OL,12,Fcrimes police were searching the
OL,13,Fbuilding of Halk TV, a pro-opposition
OL,14,Fchannel, and that 11 people had been
OL,15,Ftaken into custody in a raid linked to
OL,16,Fthe channel's owner. The government
OL,17,Falso appointed a new administrator to
OL,18,Frun the channel.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
