OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATurkish police raid opposition TV
OL,4,Astation, halting live broadcasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the latest in a series of
OL,7,Fcrackdowns on news sources deemed to be
OL,8,Fcritical of Turkish President Tayyip
OL,9,FErdoD_an and his government.
OL,11,FHalk journalists were initially unable
OL,12,Fto get into the building, although they
OL,13,Flater were allowed in, several
OL,14,Freporters said on X.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
